    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d48">

                <pb facs="0168" n="110" xml:id="pg110"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. Romero</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State, <hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1866-03-14"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 14, 1866.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your note of the 31st of January last, requesting information respecting the
                    reported capture of the town of Bagdad, on the Rio Bravo.</p>
                <p>In reply, I have to state that no official information upon the subject has been
                    received at this department.</p>
                <p>I avail myself of this occasion to renew to you, sir, the assurances of my
                    distinguished consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Señor <hi rendition="#small-caps">Matias Romero</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
